# Generated experiment result artifacts (regenerable via CLIs). The bulk was
# untracked 2026-06-17 to fix Windows MAX_PATH breakage from 260+ char sweep
# filenames. A curated set of short-named result deliverables that the site /
# paper build chain reads (pf_strategy_lab_*, urbannav_fixed_eval_*, etc.) stays
# tracked -- those were force-added and survive these ignore rules. To version a
# new deliverable use `git add -f <path>` and keep the basename short.
experiments/results/*.csv
experiments/results/*.json
experiments/results/*.md
experiments/results/*.pos
experiments/results/*.txt
experiments/results/*.npz
experiments/results/*.html
experiments/results/*.pkl
experiments/results/*.pkl.gz
experiments/results/*.parquet

